{"title":"Career Roadmap · ESG Analyst (Junior)","role":"ESG Analyst (Junior)","summary":"An ESG Analyst evaluates how an organisation performs across Environmental, Social and Governance dimensions. For a student with a Climate Science / Climate Change background, the strongest entry point is usually the Environmental side of ESG, particularly climate risk, emissions, sustainability reporting, energy, carbon accounting and environmental data.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"table","header":["Item","Roadmap"],"rows":[[{"text":"Starting point"},{"text":"Year 1 UG · 2026"}],[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"B.Sc Climate Science / Climate Change Studies"}],[{"text":"Target career"},{"text":"ESG Analyst (Junior)"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Climate · Sustainability · ESG · Environmental Risk"}],[{"text":"Primary focus"},{"text":"Climate data + emissions + sustainability reporting"}],[{"text":"Strongest advantage"},{"text":"Scientific understanding of climate and environmental systems"}],[{"text":"Important business skill"},{"text":"Translating environmental data into business decisions"}]]}],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build climate science, sustainability, data and business fundamentals"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Develop expertise in ESG reporting, carbon accounting, climate risk or sustainability consulting"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Progress toward ESG Consultant, Climate Risk Analyst, Sustainability Specialist or ESG Manager"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Lead climate strategy, transition planning, sustainability analytics and AI-enabled ESG systems"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A practical route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Climate Science","Sustainability/ESG Internship","ESG/Sustainability Analyst Trainee","Junior ESG Analyst","ESG Analyst","Senior ESG Analyst / ESG Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student can later expand from climate-focused ESG into ESG reporting, sustainable finance, climate risk, carbon markets, supply-chain sustainability or ESG consulting."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Alignment","text":"Strong"},{"type":"p","text":"Climate Science is particularly relevant to the E in ESG."},{"type":"p","text":"However, a successful ESG Analyst also needs to understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Climate Science","Carbon Accounting","Sustainability Reporting","Business","Finance","Data","Regulation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The biggest skill gap for many science graduates is therefore business and financial literacy, not climate science."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Climate + Earth-system fundamentals"},{"text":"University + NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Climate analysis assignment"},{"text":"Scientific foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Statistics + Excel"},{"text":"NPTEL + practical datasets"},{"text":"Climate-data dashboard"},{"text":"Data literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Environmental science + sustainability"},{"text":"University + research papers"},{"text":"Sustainability case study"},{"text":"Environmental knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Carbon accounting + GHG concepts"},{"text":"Sustainability resources"},{"text":"Emissions calculation project"},{"text":"ESG technical skills"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"ESG reporting + climate risk"},{"text":"Industry reports"},{"text":"ESG company assessment"},{"text":"Business understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"ESG/sustainability organisation"},{"text":"Internship report"},{"text":"Industry exposure"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced ESG + specialisation"},{"text":"Standards + reports + mentor"},{"text":"ESG analysis project"},{"text":"Professional capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Dissertation + placement preparation"},{"text":"Faculty/industry mentor"},{"text":"Dissertation + portfolio"},{"text":"Employability"}]]}]},{"heading":"Climate science foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate system"},{"text":"Atmosphere"},{"text":"Ocean systems"},{"text":"Cryosphere"},{"text":"Carbon cycle"},{"text":"Water cycle"},{"text":"Climate variability"},{"text":"Climate change"},{"text":"Greenhouse gases"},{"text":"Radiative forcing"},{"text":"Climate feedbacks"},{"text":"Extreme weather"},{"text":"Sea-level rise"},{"text":"Climate modelling fundamentals"},{"text":"Climate adaptation"},{"text":"Climate mitigation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Weather","Climate","Climate variability","Climate change"]}]},{"heading":"Greenhouse gas fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CO₂"},{"text":"Methane"},{"text":"Nitrous oxide"},{"text":"Fluorinated gases"},{"text":"Carbon dioxide equivalent"},{"text":"Global warming potential"},{"text":"Emission sources"},{"text":"Direct vs indirect emissions"},{"text":"Scope 1"},{"text":"Scope 2"},{"text":"Scope 3"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A core ESG skill is understanding:"},{"type":"h","text":"Activity data × emission factor → estimated emissions"},{"type":"p","text":"You should be able to explain the assumptions behind an emissions number rather than simply report it."}]},{"heading":"Carbon accounting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This should become one of the strongest technical skills for a Climate Science graduate entering ESG."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Direct emissions from sources controlled by the organisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Indirect emissions associated with purchased energy."},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Other value-chain emissions."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emission factors"},{"text":"Activity data"},{"text":"Organisational boundaries"},{"text":"Operational boundaries"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Emission estimation"},{"text":"Carbon inventories"},{"text":"Carbon intensity"},{"text":"Verification concepts"},{"text":"Reduction targets"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to build an organisational GHG inventory using a realistic dataset."}]},{"heading":"ESG fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand all three ESG pillars."},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate change"},{"text":"GHG emissions"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Pollution"},{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Resource efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee health and safety"},{"text":"Labour practices"},{"text":"Human rights"},{"text":"Diversity and inclusion"},{"text":"Community impact"},{"text":"Supply-chain labour standards"},{"text":"Data/privacy considerations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board structure"},{"text":"Business ethics"},{"text":"Anti-corruption"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Executive accountability"},{"text":"Whistleblower systems"},{"text":"Shareholder rights"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A climate graduate should not become an “E-only” analyst forever."},{"type":"flow","items":["Develop basic competency across E","S","G."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Sustainability reporting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how organisations communicate sustainability performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with major frameworks and standards, while recognising that reporting requirements evolve."},{"type":"p","text":"Study areas such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GRI"},{"text":"ISSB"},{"text":"IFRS Sustainability Standards"},{"text":"TCFD legacy concepts"},{"text":"SASB legacy industry metrics"},{"text":"CDP"},{"text":"UN Sustainable Development Goals"},{"text":"Double materiality"},{"text":"Materiality assessment"},{"text":"Sustainability metrics"},{"text":"ESG disclosures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India, understand the broad concept of corporate sustainability reporting and applicable regulatory requirements, particularly the BRSR ecosystem for relevant companies."},{"type":"p","text":"Standards and regulatory requirements change over time. Always verify the current applicable framework before treating a requirement as mandatory."}]},{"heading":"ESG data analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where a science graduate can differentiate themselves."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"data cleaning"},{"text":"statistical analysis"},{"text":"visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"GHG emissions"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Renewable-energy share"},{"text":"ESG targets"},{"text":"Supplier metrics"}]}]},{"heading":"Climate-risk analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Risks resulting from climate impacts."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flood"},{"text":"Heat"},{"text":"Drought"},{"text":"Cyclone"},{"text":"Wildfire"},{"text":"Water stress"},{"text":"Sea-level rise"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transition risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Risks associated with moving toward a lower-carbon economy."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbon pricing"},{"text":"Regulation"},{"text":"Technology change"},{"text":"Market changes"},{"text":"Customer expectations"},{"text":"Stranded assets"},{"text":"Energy transition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Opportunity"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Energy efficiency"},{"text":"Green products"},{"text":"Low-carbon technology"},{"text":"Climate adaptation"},{"text":"Circular economy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A useful framework is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hazard","Exposure","Vulnerability","Impact","Financial consequence"]}]},{"heading":"ESG materiality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how companies determine which sustainability issues matter most."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Materiality"},{"text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"text":"Impact materiality"},{"text":"Financial materiality"},{"text":"Double materiality"},{"text":"Materiality matrices"},{"text":"Stakeholder engagement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good ESG Analyst should be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Which sustainability issues are most important to this organisation, and why?"}]},{"heading":"Sustainable finance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest ways to move from a science background into higher-value ESG work."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG investing"},{"text":"Sustainable finance"},{"text":"Green bonds"},{"text":"Sustainability-linked bonds"},{"text":"Climate risk"},{"text":"Transition finance"},{"text":"ESG ratings"},{"text":"ESG funds"},{"text":"Carbon markets"},{"text":"Internal carbon pricing"},{"text":"Climate-related financial risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand that ESG analysis and ESG investing are related but distinct career tracks."}]},{"heading":"Business and financial literacy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income statement"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Capex"},{"text":"Opex"},{"text":"ROI"},{"text":"Cost-benefit analysis"},{"text":"Business risk"},{"text":"Enterprise risk"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Corporate strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term objective is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Climate impact","operational impact","financial impact","business decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"That is the transition from a climate graduate to a high-value ESG professional."}]},{"heading":"Climate policy and regulation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the broad policy environment surrounding:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Paris Agreement"},{"text":"National climate policies"},{"text":"Carbon markets"},{"text":"Renewable-energy policy"},{"text":"Energy transition"},{"text":"Climate disclosure"},{"text":"Corporate sustainability reporting"},{"text":"Environmental regulations"},{"text":"Climate finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an India-focused career, monitor developments from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ministry of Environment, Forest and Climate Change"},{"text":"Ministry of Power"},{"text":"Ministry of New and Renewable Energy"},{"text":"SEBI"},{"text":"RBI"},{"text":"NITI Aayog"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use official sources when checking current requirements."}]},{"heading":"ESG technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG data platforms"},{"text":"Sustainability reporting systems"},{"text":"Carbon-accounting tools"},{"text":"LCA tools"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Climate datasets"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Climate Science provides an advantage in:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS","Remote Sensing","Climate Data","ESG"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This can become a strong niche."}]},{"heading":"Life-cycle assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop introductory knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Life Cycle Assessment (LCA)"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Goal and scope"},{"text":"System boundaries"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Impact assessment"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Product carbon footprint"},{"text":"Cradle-to-gate"},{"text":"Cradle-to-grave"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Explore tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"openLCA"},{"text":"SimaPro concepts"},{"text":"GaBi/Sphera concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact software access and licensing should be verified."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Best for","Senior direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"ESG Reporting"},{"text":"ESG data + reporting frameworks"},{"text":"Corporate sustainability"},{"text":"ESG Manager"}],[{"text":"Carbon Accounting"},{"text":"GHG + emissions + data"},{"text":"Technical climate work"},{"text":"Carbon Specialist"}],[{"text":"Climate Risk"},{"text":"Climate science + finance"},{"text":"Analytical students"},{"text":"Climate Risk Consultant"}],[{"text":"Sustainability Consulting"},{"text":"ESG + business + strategy"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"ESG Consultant"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Finance"},{"text":"ESG + finance"},{"text":"Finance-oriented students"},{"text":"Sustainable Finance Analyst"}],[{"text":"Climate Data"},{"text":"Python + GIS + climate data"},{"text":"Technical students"},{"text":"Climate Data Scientist"}],[{"text":"Environmental Risk"},{"text":"Climate + environmental assessment"},{"text":"Risk-oriented students"},{"text":"Environmental Risk Specialist"}],[{"text":"LCA"},{"text":"LCA + sustainability"},{"text":"Product/environment analysis"},{"text":"LCA Specialist"}],[{"text":"Supply-chain ESG"},{"text":"ESG + procurement + data"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Supply-Chain Sustainability Lead"}],[{"text":"ESG Technology"},{"text":"Data + ESG + software"},{"text":"Digital students"},{"text":"ESG Data/Product Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Climate Science student should build evidence-based ESG projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Corporate carbon footprint"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a hypothetical or publicly reported company."},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scope 1"},{"text":"Scope 2"},{"text":"selected Scope 3 categories"},{"text":"total emissions"},{"text":"emissions intensity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel/Python dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — ESG company assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a listed company and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate targets"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Emissions"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Workforce"},{"text":"Governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a structured ESG report."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Climate-risk assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a hypothetical manufacturing facility."},{"type":"p","text":"Assess:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Flood","heat","water stress","transition risk"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Then estimate potential business consequences."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — ESG dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GHG emissions"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"ESG targets"},{"text":"Year-on-year changes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — GIS climate-risk project"},{"type":"p","text":"Use GIS/open climate datasets to map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flood exposure"},{"text":"Heat exposure"},{"text":"Drought"},{"text":"Water stress"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then connect the environmental exposure to business locations."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Final-year project"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong dissertation could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Climate Risk and ESG Performance Assessment of an Indian Industrial Sector”"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"“Carbon Footprint and Decarbonisation Pathway for a Manufacturing Organisation.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"For a 4-year Honours/Honours with Research programme, use the additional year for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced climate modelling"},{"text":"Climate economics"},{"text":"ESG reporting"},{"text":"Carbon accounting"},{"text":"Climate-risk modelling"},{"text":"GIS and remote sensing"},{"text":"Sustainability analytics"},{"text":"LCA"},{"text":"Environmental economics"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Industry internship"},{"text":"Dissertation"},{"text":"ESG case study"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A research-oriented honours project should produce a quantitative climate/ESG analysis, not only a descriptive literature review."},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant · 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"ESG is becoming increasingly data-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"The future workflow will increasingly resemble:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental data","ESG metrics","Risk modelling","Financial impact","Scenario analysis","Corporate strategy"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important future areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate-risk analytics"},{"text":"AI-powered ESG data extrac